From e229bed37099e91a29ae96b671aa78bd09a6c616 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:12:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): 'created' sidebar sort stops reshuffling on
 activity [daveey]

Under date grouping the created sort only re-slotted rows inside date
buckets cut by last_active, so a reply in an old chat lifted it into the
newest bucket and reordered the list. The created key now drives the base
sort, branch-cluster order and the date buckets (started_at).
